		{"id":"a0f5b29feb6dd9ba","type":"text","text":"### Biological Analogies\n\n| Circuit Component | Purpose                  | Biological System Equivalent                                                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Bulb              | Output                   | Muscle Contraction                                                                                                        |\n| Resistor          | Signal Modification      | Inhibitors (+ve resistance)<br>Stimulators (-ve resistance)                                                               |\n| Switch            | ON/OFF Signal conduction | Ion channels                                                                                                              |\n| A                 | Resting Potential        | Basal Electrical Activity produced by Gray Matter <br>BER in GIT -> Interstitial Cells of Cajal<br>SRAP in CVS -> SA Node |\n| B                 | Input Potential          | Action Potential                                                                                                          |\n","x":3020,"y":745,"width":720,"height":385},
